          "expect": { "skip": true, "reason_contains": "Cant find good isoline" },
          "notes": "leg 分支缺 attapos → 无从投影 → skip，不硬塞"
        },
        {
          "id": "LEG-SKID",
          "objecttype": "ISOLEG",
          "name": "LEGY",
          "elboname": "EA",
          "ori_zdir": [0, 1, 0],
          "attapos": [500, 0, 0],
          "pos": [500, 0, 40],
          "expect": { "skip": true, "reason_contains": "Cant find good isoline" },
          "notes": "attapos 能投影到段0，但 zdir=Y 对两段折叠角都=90≥1 → 平行度筛掉全部候选 → skip"
        },
        {
          "id": "NAME-GHOST",
          "objecttype": "ISOMATERIAL",
          "name": "ZZZ",
          "member_adir": [-1, 0, 0],
          "member_ldir": [1, 0, 0],
          "pos": [500, 0, 40],
          "expect": { "skip": true, "reason_contains": "Cant find good isoline" },
          "notes": "名字不在任何 isoline.mems → 候选空 → skip（路径 B 无命中）"
        },
        {
          "id": "NAME-NULLDIR",
          "objecttype": "ISOMATERIAL",
          "name": "EB",
          "member_adir": null,
          "member_ldir": null,
          "pos": [1120, 0, 700],
          "expect": { "isoline": 1, "write": "append" },
          "notes": "adir/ldir 皆缺 → samedirs 落到 `_ => true` 臂 → 首命中 break；EB 仅在段1 → 单候选归段1"
        },
        {
          "id": "WTX-NOFLIP",
          "objecttype": "ISOWELDTEXT",
          "name": "EB",
          "name_is_atta": false,
          "member_adir": null,
          "member_ldir": null,
          "pos": [1080, 0, 600],
          "movedir": [1, 0, 0],
          "movedis": 40,
          "expect": {
            "isoline": 1,
            "write": "append",
            "final_pos": [1120, 0, 600]
          },
          "notes": "movedis≠0 但 movedir∠showdir1([1,0,0])=0≤90 → 不翻转，直接沿 +X 偏 40 → [1120,0,600]（对照课48 WTX-EA 的翻转分支）"
        }
      ],
      "expect_bags": {
        "0": ["MBD-T1", "ADJ-W1", "MAT-T1"],
        "1": ["NAME-NULLDIR", "WTX-NOFLIP"]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "parallel-runs-distance-tiebreak",
      "title": "课47/48 补：上下平行双段——leg 双候选按距离取近、桥接焊缝字/ATTA 焊缝字按距离决胜（两方向都验）",
      "notes": "换一套几何：段0、段1同向水平([1,0,0])、仅 Z 相隔 300，EA 为共享桥接件。此时非焊缝字『更水平』决胜会并列，故本例只用 leg/焊缝字的距离决胜，避免依赖并列的实现细节。",
      "isolines": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "mems": ["HEAD", "T1", "EA"],
          "p0": [0, 0, 0],
          "p1": [1000, 0, 0],
          "pipedir": [1, 0, 0],
          "showdir": [0, 0, 1]
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "mems": ["EA", "T2", "EB"],
